  "details": "Low priority request\n\nAdd world information to \"auth/user\" that will display public and private information.\n\nThis will allow people that still want to get information about their own private instance to get it.\n\nA example for that it could be utilized for is the Developer Meetup event where I stream the worlds we visit and on the stream I also have world information for all the worlds we visit.\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/0ol1cko.png\n\nThis however doesn't work when we have to go into private instances.\n\n\nAgain, low priority request, but would still like to see this added.",
